---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How eduAssets handles personal data and browsing information." locale="en" path="privacy-policy">
  <main class="container legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: November 12, 2026.</p>
    <h2>Scope</h2>
    <p>This policy applies to the eduAssets institutional website at <strong>eduassets.tech</strong>, maintained by Thiago da Silva. The platform at <strong>app.eduassets.tech</strong> has its own policy, available on the app entry screen (<a href="https://app.eduassets.tech/#privacidade">app Privacy Policy</a>).</p>
    <h2>Data collection</h2>
    <p>This landing page has no forms, log-in or advertising and does not ask for personal data. It stores in your browser only functional preferences (theme, page position when switching language and your cookie choice), described in the <a href="/en/cookies-policy/">cookies policy</a>.</p>
    <p>Only if you accept statistics cookies does the site load Google Analytics, which records in aggregate the pages visited, where the visit came from and technical browser and device data. Google signals and ad personalization are turned off. Without consent, no Google script is loaded.</p>
    <h2>Purpose and legal basis</h2>
    <p>Functional preferences make the site work the way you chose. Statistics help us understand how the site is used and improve it, based on your consent (Brazilian LGPD art. 7, I), which you can refuse or withdraw at any time with the <strong>Cookie preferences</strong> button, in the home page footer or below.</p>
    <h2>Sharing and retention</h2>
    <p>We do not sell data. The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes requests to deliver the pages, and the documentation reader loads guides from <strong>docs.eduassets.tech</strong>. With your consent, statistics data is processed by Google, which may process it outside Brazil; Google Analytics cookies last up to 2 years in the browser and events are kept for the retention period configured in the property. Refusing deletes those cookies. Local preferences stay in the browser until you clear the site data.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>To confirm, access, correct or delete data, withdraw consent or ask privacy questions (LGPD art. 18), contact the email shown in the home page footer. You may also file a complaint with the Brazilian Data Protection Authority (ANPD).</p>
    <p><button type="button" class="cookie-preferences-btn" data-open-cookie-preferences>Cookie preferences</button></p>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/en/">Back to the website</a>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
